WEBVTT

00:00:28.352 --> 00:00:34.451
inklar chaki-onki, inglizlar esa 
tuberkulyoz deb yuritishgan.

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:37.313
Bugungi kunda sil eng keng tarqalgan

00:00:37.313 --> 00:00:40.344
yuqumli kasalliklardan biri bo'lib,

00:00:40.344 --> 00:00:45.104
bezgak va hatto OIV va OITSdan ham 
ko'proq qurbonlarga sabab bo'lmoqda.

00:00:45.104 --> 00:00:51.183
Sil aslida qanday kasallik va nima uchun 
bu patogenlar hali ham yo'q qilinmagan?

00:00:51.183 --> 00:00:57.201
Mycobacterium tuberculosis deb ataluvchi 
patogenlar havo tomchilari orqali yuqadi.

00:00:57.201 --> 00:01:00.618
Ular havo yo'llariga kirib, 
o'pkani kasallantiradi.